      "diff": "@@ -20,9 +20,31 @@ If you or your organization would like to contribute or become a sponsor, please\n \n === Bug Fixes\n \n-// The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n+The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n \n-// * wssalink:2025-07[] {notable}\n+* wssalink:2025-07[] {notable}\n+HTTP3 dissector crash.\n+wsbuglink:20860[].\n+// cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n+// Fixed in master: 9139917bd8\n+// Fixed in release-4.6: 38df909ca8\n+// Fixed in release-4.4: 3911b2958d\n+// CVSS AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H\n+// CWE-1325\n+// * HTTP/3 dissector freezes on a large number of headers. wsbuglink:20860[].\n+\n+* wssalink:2025-08[] {notable}\n+MEGACO dissector infinite loop.\n+wsbuglink:20884[].\n+// cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n+// Fixed in master: aba1fbe626\n+// Fixed in release-4.6: 4f79070084\n+// Fixed in release-4.4: e4f3706e1b\n+// AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H\n+// CWE-835\n+// * Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-11-30-12267984256.pcap. wsbuglink:20884[].\n+\n+// * wssalink:2025-09[] {notable}\n // Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n // wsbuglink:xxx[].\n // cveidlink:2025-xxx[].\n@@ -39,6 +61,9 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark took a bite out of each of your freshly baked muffins until it found the perfect one. {notable}\n \n+* ws_base32_decode should be named *_encode ? wsbuglink:20754[].\n+* Stack buffer overflow in wiretap/ber.c (ber_open) wsbuglink:20878[].\n+* Fuzz job crash: fuzz-2025-11-30-12266121180.pcap. wsbuglink:20883[].\n \n // == Known Bugs\n \n@@ -58,6 +83,9 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n // rg -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v4.4.11.. | rg packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+Fc00\n+MEGACO\n+SMTP\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n",
